<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 671.75 mln dirham.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 671.75 mln dirham.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 671.75 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks	50.00	   50.00		   8.00</p>
<p>    52 weeks     266.75	  266.75		   8.50</p>
<p>    Two years     50.00	    50.00		  8.80</p>
<p>    Five years     170	     170		    9.50</p>
<p>    10-years	  80		80		   10.00</p>
<p>    15-years	  55		55		   10.25</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    671.75	  671.75</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for May 26, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.33 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
